DESCRIPTION:You're invited to celebrate the Toronto launch of Sumaiya Mati
 n's debut picture book\, PARSA'S PITHAS!\nSeven-year-old Parsa is struggl
 ing with an art project for school. When she joins her Ma in the kitchen t
 o prepare pithas for the Bengali New Year (Pohela Boishakhi Mela)\, she fa
 ces new obstacles. Engaging with the folk art of pitha making\, she learns
  to tap into her own creative superpower--and there is no stopping her aft
 er that!\n*PARSA'S PITHAS\, by Sumaiya Matin and Nesba Yousef (illus.) wil
 l be available for purchase at the event.\nThis book celebrates Bengali he
 ritage and will make a great addition to any home or school library.\nAdmi
 ssion: Free. Fun for the whole family - all are welcome!
LOCATION:777 Bathurst St.
URL:https://adifferentbooklist.com/events
X-SOURCE:A Different Booklist
